  "title": "IUA: Prevent undefined behavior",
  "description": "Due to the C integer promotions, uint16_t become signed int when\nperforming arithmetic operations on them. Just put them into\nuint32_t initially. Also use proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint where\nwe can.\n\nOSS-Fuzz 467517882",
